# ArraySpeciesCreate on a plain array finds Array itself and makes an array at its site; on an instance of a class that extends Array and has a static Symbol.species getter it runs the getter and constructs what the getter answers as well
# RUN(PLAIN): flow-solve nodes
# RUN(SUBCLASS): flow-solve nodes
# RUN(ARRAY): flow-solve nodes
# RUN(GETTER): flow-links calls
# RUN(CONSTRUCTOR): flow-links calls
# RUN(NOWHERE): flow-solve nodes
# RUN(UNLINKED): flow-links calls
